<div class="about-page">
  <h1>About the Data Library</h1>

  <p>The UK Parliament Data Library provides access to research publications and deposited papers from the UK Parliament.</p>

  <h2>What's Available</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Research Briefings</strong> - In-depth analysis and background information on policy issues, produced by the House of Commons Library and House of Lords Library.</li>
    <li><strong>Deposited Papers</strong> - Documents deposited in the Libraries of both Houses by government departments and other bodies.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Data Source</h2>
  <p>All data is sourced from the UK Parliament's open data platform.</p>
</div>
